    "id": "message:sup:DEMO-F1:6",
    "kind": "conversation",
    "text": "{\"message_id\": \"msg:DEMO-F1-3-6\", \"from\": \"sales@DEMO-F1\", \"subject\": \"Re: Quote from Demo Gießerei GmbH: Pump housing PH-100: the foundry wants +8.8 %\", \"body\": \"Guten Tag,\\n\\nWe thank you for your revised proposal and the constructive dialogue. As a family-run foundry with deep roots in our region, we have always valued the long and trustful relationship between our companies. We have reviewed your offer and can adjust our Angebot as follows. In response to your step, we are prepared to adjust our price to €50.50 per unit for the agreed terms. \\n\\nOur Angebot comprises a price of €50.50 per unit, a Zahlungsziel 45 days net, a contract term of 24 months, valid from 1 December 2026. This offer remains valid for 30 days.\\n\\nWe believe this brings us very close to a fair agreement that honors our long-standing relationship. My team and I look forward to continuing our successful cooperation for many years to come.\\n\\nViele Grüße aus der Gießerei\\nAndreas Moser\\nOwner, Demo Gießerei GmbH\", \"refs\": [], \"action\": null, \"term_sheets\": [{\"term_sheet_id\": \"offer:DEMO-F1-3\", \"terms\": {\"unit_price\": 50.5, \"payment_days\": 45, \"contract_months\": 24, \"effective_date\": \"2026-12-01\"}}], \"status\": \"open\", \"claim_results\": [], \"missing_fields\": [], \"attachments\": []}"
